    description  : NanoXplore NG_MEDIUM Board of the test esw/user.c            - Without Supervisor, Safety Lock Step, Without Fault Injection
    generate : [gen_picoblaze3_user_c_uart_9600,gen_picoblaze3_supervisor_c_dummy]
